{"id": "182100", "name": "סכום טור חזקות מוכר – זיהוי n·cos(kπ) מטור מקלורן של cos (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Find</p>\n<p>\\[{{CT:0}} + \\frac{{{CT:1}} \\pi^2}{2!} - \\frac{{{CT:2}} \\pi^4}{4!} +\\frac{{{CT:3}} \\pi^6}{6!} - \\ldots.\\]</p>\n<p>Answer: [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>\\[{{CT:0}} + \\frac{{{CT:1}} \\pi^2}{2!} - \\frac{{{CT:2}} \\pi^4}{4!} +\\frac{{{CT:3}} \\pi^6}{6!} - \\ldots.\\]</p>\n<p>can be written as</p>\n<p>\\[{{CT:0}}(1 - \\frac{{{CT:4}} \\pi^2}{2!} + \\frac{{{CT:5}} \\pi^4}{4!} -\\frac{{{CT:6}} \\pi^6}{6!} + \\ldots.)\\]</p>\n<p>\\[{{CT:0}}(1 - \\frac{({{CT:7}} \\pi)^2}{2!} + \\frac{({{CT:7}} \\pi)^4}{4!} -\\frac{({{CT:7}} \\pi)^6}{6!} + \\ldots.)\\]</p>\n<p>which equals \\[{{CT:0}} *\\cos({{CT:7}} \\pi) = {{CT:8}}\\]</p>\n<p> </p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff,taylor,sum,solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode